 "kind": "consensus",
 "role": "collagen_percent",
 "description": "The verdict input for radiocarbon and isotopes on both instrument classes (high-res after the transfer): the median of three 1-LV PLS collagen models calibrated on the 140 Ryder et al. 2026 reference bones, OH-corrected 2045 nm, OH-corrected 1545 nm (1500-1550 nm window) and the OH-corrected N-H set (component key F05). Each component is its shipped model folded exactly into one linear functional of absorbance (an SG derivative is linear); the three component values are reported beside the median. The median shrugs off one failing component (an altered OH/water band at 2045 nm, a coating at one window, noise on high-res SWIR2). Verdict cut-offs belong to the analysis profiles.",
