  "text": "SPYDER Bone (CONS3 consensus); calibration data Ryder, C. et al. 2026. Refining near-infrared spectroscopy for collagen quantification in archaeological bone. Journal of Archaeological Science 185:106448 (calibration spectra and yields: supplement mmc2).",
